      "source": "Extension for <a href=\"../../spring-beans/org.springframework.beans.factory/-bean-factory/get-bean.html\">BeanFactory.getBean</a> providing a <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">getBean&lt;Foo&gt;()</code> variant. This extension is not subject to type erasure and retains actual generic type arguments.",
      "translation": "为 `<a href=\"../../spring-beans/org.springframework.beans.factory/-bean-factory/get-bean.html\">BeanFactory.getBean</a>` 提供的扩展，包含一个 `<code class=\"lang-kotlin\">getBean&lt;Foo&gt;()</code>` 变体。此扩展不受类型擦除影响，并保留实际的泛型类型参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Extension for <a href=\"../../spring-beans/org.springframework.beans.factory/-bean-factory/get-bean.html\">BeanFactory.getBean</a> providing a <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">getBean&lt;Foo&gt;(\"foo\")</code> variant. Like the original Java method, this extension is subject to type erasure.",
      "translation": "为 `<a href=\"../../spring-beans/org.springframework.beans.factory/-bean-factory/get-bean.html\">BeanFactory.getBean</a>` 提供 `getBean&lt;Foo&gt;(\"foo\")` 变体的扩展。与原始 Java 方法一样，此扩展也受类型擦除的影响。",
      "count": 2
